{
  "$comment": [
    "The money census for the Node binding's output surface, maintained by hand.",
    "test/money-exactness.js reads it and asserts that",
    "(a) every field listed under `money` has a `<field>Exact` string twin in the",
    "generated index.d.ts, and",
    "(b) every f64 field on every `*Output` struct in src/lib.rs appears here as",
    "either money or notMoney.",
    "So a new float money field without a twin fails, and any new float output",
    "field fails until someone decides which it is.",
    "`notMoney` holds rates, percentages, scores, quantities, distances and",
    "durations: values that are not currency amounts and need no exact twin."
  ],
